{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Note:</strong></u> Separated is a co-op only game (2 players have to own the game to play together). It heavily relies on voice chat communication. A microphone is required and headphones are highly recommended. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2976110/extras/ea0c098e5c6e0ebfcef91d8ac8e6824d.avif?t=1770951808\" width=600 height=75 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You and your friend are trapped in two connected houses. You have to communicate to solve puzzles with two different perspectives.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2976110/extras/2325e3cf77ee8a2596653813a60f67c6.poster.avif?t=1770951808\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2976110/extras/2325e3cf77ee8a2596653813a60f67c6.webm?t=1770951808\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2976110/extras/2325e3cf77ee8a2596653813a60f67c6.mp4?t=1770951808\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2976110/extras/1fec01aba188b8930852708906f7f9c8.avif?t=1770951808\" width=600 height=75 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There's a blind entity roaming around. Whenever you hear it, you have to be very quiet or it will come for you! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2976110/extras/ffbcd5f4a4df9e1dcb43c29372a47ba7.poster.avif?t=1770951808\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2976110/extras/ffbcd5f4a4df9e1dcb43c29372a47ba7.webm?t=1770951808\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2976110/extras/ffbcd5f4a4df9e1dcb43c29372a47ba7.mp4?t=1770951808\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2976110/extras/3b3c6c6eeee1133e106574a0ecf6bb22.avif?t=1770951808\" width=600 height=75 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you escape the clutches of the entity before it's too late?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2976110/extras/1f61b37d9c5d30fda67a9da722997e7c.poster.avif?t=1770951808\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2976110/extras/1f61b37d9c5d30fda67a9da722997e7c.webm?t=1770951808\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2976110/extras/1f61b37d9c5d30fda67a9da722997e7c.mp4?t=1770951808\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2976110?t=1770951808","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2976110/f6dbaf4d0e56fa62c3f9899d21d664ae680a1f39/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1770951808","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2976110/7d43646959dd8db6400cd317ba2a749e850739eb/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1770951808","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2976110/7d43646959dd8db64